+
+impl<'a> IsoFirstDerivs<'a> {
+    /// The net `surface` evaluates its first derivatives on, resolved as
+    /// [`Surface::evaluate_simple_first_into`] resolves it on each call (an analytic
+    /// kind's NURB is made then, as on that call); `None` where that evaluation does
